      "message": "fix(2d): name the containment when an Auto picked ring stands in the part\n\nThe picked-ring law gave the Outside text for Side Auto. With Auto the\nring moves into the part through the region (a tool containment or an\noffset), so the message now says so.\n\nTwo tests pinned the old silent top-plane pass:\n- area_open: a forced Containment Outside on a bore rim is now refused\n  by name before a move (renamed to ..._is_refused_by_name).\n- tilt: the flat control used Inside on a block top face; it uses\n  Outside, the legal side for that ring.\n\nAlso a type alias for the contour part tuple (clippy type_complexity).\n\nRefs #1927\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
