      "message": "fix(2d): give the picked-ring refusal advice that fits each cause\n\nThe side the law reads is the resolved one: the app turns Auto into\nInside or Outside first, and a tool containment moves the ring too. The\nrefusal no longer says \"use Auto\"; it names the side to set and the\ncontainment.\n\narea_open now pins three cases on the blind bore rim: Inside is clean,\na forced Containment Outside is refused, and Auto (which reads the\nblind bore as material and resolves to Outside) is refused with the\nside to set. The test file of #1927 takes the new texts and a Picker\nalias (clippy).\n\nRefs #1927\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
